  "details": "1. I think it would be great to have a download emoji folder for VRChat where you can upload or download emojis and display them in-game. \n\n2. Another idea is to have a necessary emojis for VRChat. These are emojis that may prove to be very commonly used like: \"use optimized avatars\", \"please be polite\", \"check your discord (or check chat)\", \"I'm a mute\", \"sleeping\", \"tired\", \"hungry\", \"brb\", \"g2g\", \"nsfw\",\"sfw\", \"18+ only\", \"let's be friends\", or \"no drama please\".\n\nI think we can further expand upon and make great use of emojis to have more forms of creativity and communication in VRChat.",
